{
    "dashboard": {
        "id": null,
        "title": "🤖💎 HYPERFOCUS PRODUCTIVITY ANALYTICS - AI INSIGHTS 💎🤖",
        "tags": [
            "hyperfocus",
            "productivity",
            "ai",
            "analytics"
        ],
        "style": "dark",
        "timezone": "browser",
        "editable": true,
        "time": {
            "from": "now-6h",
            "to": "now"
        },
        "refresh": "30s",
        "panels": [
            {
                "id": 1,
                "title": "⚡ HYPERFOCUS SESSION TRACKER",
                "type": "timeseries",
                "targets": [
                    {
                        "expr": "rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[15m]) * 100",
                        "legendFormat": "🧠 Focus Intensity (CPU Activity)"
                    },
                    {
                        "expr": "avg_over_time(rate(container_network_receive_bytes_total{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m])[15m:1m]) / 1024",
                        "legendFormat": "🌐 Knowledge Absorption (Network KB/s)"
                    }
                ],
                "fieldConfig": {
                    "defaults": {
                        "custom": {
                            "drawStyle": "line",
                            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
                            "fillOpacity": 25,
                            "gradientMode": "hue",
                            "lineWidth": 3
                        },
                        "color": {
                            "mode": "continuous-BlPu"
                        },
                        "unit": "percent"
                    }
                },
                "gridPos": {
                    "h": 8,
                    "w": 24,
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 0
                }
            },
            {
                "id": 2,
                "title": "🎯 PRODUCTIVITY SCORE CALCULATOR",
                "type": "gauge",
                "targets": [
                    {
                        "expr": "avg(((rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m]) * 100) + (rate(container_network_receive_bytes_total{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m]) / 1024 / 10)) / 2)",
                        "legendFormat": "Productivity Score"
                    }
                ],
                "fieldConfig": {
                    "defaults": {
                        "min": 0,
                        "max": 100,
                        "unit": "percent",
                        "color": {
                            "mode": "thresholds"
                        },
                        "thresholds": {
                            "steps": [
                                {
                                    "color": "red",
                                    "value": 0
                                },
                                {
                                    "color": "yellow",
                                    "value": 30
                                },
                                {
                                    "color": "green",
                                    "value": 60
                                },
                                {
                                    "color": "blue",
                                    "value": 80
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        "mappings": [
                            {
                                "options": {
                                    "from": 0,
                                    "to": 30
                                },
                                "result": {
                                    "text": "😴 Rest Mode"
                                },
                                "type": "range"
                            },
                            {
                                "options": {
                                    "from": 30,
                                    "to": 60
                                },
                                "result": {
                                    "text": "🚶 Active"
                                },
                                "type": "range"
                            },
                            {
                                "options": {
                                    "from": 60,
                                    "to": 80
                                },
                                "result": {
                                    "text": "🏃 Productive"
                                },
                                "type": "range"
                            },
                            {
                                "options": {
                                    "from": 80,
                                    "to": 100
                                },
                                "result": {
                                    "text": "⚡ HYPERFOCUS!"
                                },
                                "type": "range"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                },
                "gridPos": {
                    "h": 8,
                    "w": 12,
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 8
                }
            },
            {
                "id": 3,
                "title": "🧠 FOCUS PATTERN ANALYSIS",
                "type": "heatmap",
                "targets": [
                    {
                        "expr": "avg_over_time(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m])[1h:5m]) * 100",
                        "legendFormat": "Focus Intensity by Time"
                    }
                ],
                "fieldConfig": {
                    "defaults": {
                        "custom": {
                            "hideFrom": {
                                "legend": false,
                                "tooltip": false,
                                "vis": false
                            }
                        },
                        "color": {
                            "mode": "spectrum"
                        }
                    }
                },
                "gridPos": {
                    "h": 8,
                    "w": 12,
                    "x": 12,
                    "y": 8
                }
            },
            {
                "id": 4,
                "title": "📊 DOPAMINE GUARDIAN METRICS",
                "type": "stat",
                "targets": [
                    {
                        "expr": "count(up{job=~\".*empire.*\"} == 1)",
                        "legendFormat": "🛡️ Active Guardians"
                    },
                    {
                        "expr": "avg(rate(container_memory_usage_bytes{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m]) / 1024 / 1024)",
                        "legendFormat": "🧠 Memory Flow (MB/s)"
                    },
                    {
                        "expr": "count(changes(up{job=~\".*empire.*\"}[1h]) > 0)",
                        "legendFormat": "⚡ Energy Bursts"
                    }
                ],
                "fieldConfig": {
                    "defaults": {
                        "color": {
                            "mode": "thresholds"
                        },
                        "thresholds": {
                            "steps": [
                                {
                                    "color": "red",
                                    "value": 0
                                },
                                {
                                    "color": "yellow",
                                    "value": 1
                                },
                                {
                                    "color": "green",
                                    "value": 3
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                },
                "gridPos": {
                    "h": 6,
                    "w": 24,
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 16
                }
            },
            {
                "id": 5,
                "title": "🎨 CREATIVE FLOW TRENDLINES",
                "type": "timeseries",
                "targets": [
                    {
                        "expr": "predict_linear(avg_over_time(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m])[30m:5m]) * 100[30m:5m], 1800)",
                        "legendFormat": "🔮 Focus Trend (30min prediction)"
                    },
                    {
                        "expr": "holt_winters(avg_over_time(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{name=~\".*empire.*\"}[5m])[1h:5m]) * 100[2h:5m], 0.3, 0.3)",
                        "legendFormat": "🌊 Flow Pattern (Holt-Winters)"
                    }
                ],
                "fieldConfig": {
                    "defaults": {
                        "custom": {
                            "drawStyle": "line",
                            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
                            "lineWidth": 2,
                            "fillOpacity": 15,
                            "gradientMode": "hue",
                            "lineStyle": {
                                "dash": [
                                    10,
                                    5
                                ]
                            }
                        },
                        "color": {
                            "mode": "continuous-RdYlGr"
                        }
                    }
                },
                "gridPos": {
                    "h": 8,
                    "w": 24,
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 22
                }
            },
            {
                "id": 6,
                "title": "🚀 EMPIRE PRODUCTIVITY INSIGHTS",
                "type": "text",
                "options": {
                    "content": "## 🎯 **HYPERFOCUS ANALYTICS DASHBOARD**\n\n### 📈 **Current Session Analysis:**\n- **Focus State:** Monitor your real-time productivity levels\n- **Flow Patterns:** Identify peak performance periods\n- **Energy Management:** Track cognitive load and recovery cycles\n\n### 🧠 **ADHD-Optimized Metrics:**\n- **⚡ Hyperfocus Detection:** Automatic identification of deep work sessions\n- **🎨 Creative Bursts:** Tracking innovation and creative output\n- **🛡️ Dopamine Guardian:** Monitoring motivation and engagement levels\n- **🌊 Flow State Analysis:** Understanding optimal work conditions\n\n### 🎯 **Actionable Insights:**\n1. **Peak Hours:** Your highest productivity typically occurs during detected focus bursts\n2. **Recovery Patterns:** Monitor energy dips to schedule breaks effectively\n3. **Flow Triggers:** Identify activities and conditions that enhance focus\n4. **Optimization Opportunities:** Use trendlines to plan hyperfocus sessions\n\n### 💎 **BROski Pro Tips:**\n- 🎵 **Music Correlation:** Cross-reference with audio activity for focus enhancement\n- 🌅 **Time Blocking:** Use pattern analysis for optimal schedule planning\n- ⚡ **Energy Mapping:** Align challenging tasks with predicted peak periods\n- 🎯 **Goal Tracking:** Set productivity targets based on historical patterns\n\n**🏰👑 Your ADHD superpowers are being monitored and optimized! 👑🏰**",
                    "mode": "markdown"
                },
                "gridPos": {
                    "h": 10,
                    "w": 24,
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 30
                }
            }
        ],
        "templating": {
            "list": [
                {
                    "name": "focus_period",
                    "type": "interval",
                    "query": "5m,15m,30m,1h,2h,6h",
                    "current": {
                        "text": "15m",
                        "value": "15m"
                    }
                }
            ]
        }
    }
}